/target
/.vscode
.claude
CLAUDE.md
*.env
.env.*
# The frontend's two mode files hold only values that are inlined into the public bundle
# anyway — the API origin and a Stripe *publishable* sandbox key — and the CI image build
# needs .env.production, so these two are committed. Never put a secret in them.
!apps/frontend/.env.development
!apps/frontend/.env.production
# Kubernetes non-secret config, one file per service. Secrets sit beside it in
# secrets.env, which stays ignored.
!k8s/environments/*/config/*.env
/uploads
# Vendored Helm subchart tarballs. Chart.lock IS committed — it pins the
# resolved NATS version, so `helm dependency update` is reproducible.
k8s/chart/charts/
.cargo
.fallow

/driveway-pictures
/ourdriveway-logo
# Local planning notes, not part of the repo.
/ANDROID_APP_LINKS_PLAN.md
